      <Validation></Validation>
      <Description><![CDATA[How one slide changes to the next: Fade (default), Slide (moves sideways, mirrored in Arabic), Rise (the text lines rise in one after another), Zoom (with a slow zoom on the background) or Blur. Visitors who reduce motion get a plain switch.]]></Description>
